Alpha Safety Circle,

You are invited to the internal aggregate safety review for the Sakura Clinical
Study Alpha 2026 snapshot dated 02 September 2026.

When: 03 September 2026, 14:00–14:45 JST
Where: Clinical VDI review room (internal calendar entry)
Material: frozen synthetic cohort summary (48 records)

Agenda
1. Confirm that aggregate event coding and seriousness categories reconcile.
2. Review whether the safety narrative supports interpretation of the parent
   endpoint at the 2.5 mg threshold.
3. Record questions or follow-up analyses without altering the frozen snapshot.

This meeting concerns synthetic, aggregate study materials only. It is not a
clinical care meeting and no individual-level information will be discussed.

Please reply to the group mailbox if the timing prevents attendance.

Synthetic Safety Review
Sakura Clinical

